@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. View Native OpenAPI Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### ==========================================
### 2. LICENSE CLASSES
### ==========================================

### Get All 7 License Classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/license-classes

### Get License Class by ID (Class 3 - Standard Car)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/license-classes/3

### Get All Countries (nationality choices for a person)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries

### ==========================================
### 3. PEOPLE
### ==========================================

### Get All People
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people

### Get Person by ID (Ahmad Al-Sayed - Eligible adult)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/1

### Get a Person's Licenses (empty until their first license is issued)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/1/licenses

### Get Person by National ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/by-national-no/N1001

### Create a New Person
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/people
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalNo": "N2001",
  "firstName": "Zaid",
  "secondName": "Omar",
  "thirdName": "Tariq",
  "lastName": "Husseini",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-05-15T00:00:00Z",
  "gender": 0,
  "address": "Gardens Street, Amman",
  "phone": "+962791234567",
  "email": "zaid.husseini@example.com",
  "nationalityCountryId": 1,
  "imagePath": null
}

### ==========================================
### 4. LOCAL DRIVING LICENSE APPLICATIONS
### ==========================================

### Test Chain of Responsibility: Underage Applicant Rejection (Sara, 16 yrs applying for Class 3) -> Returns HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/local-license
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantPersonId": 2,
  "licenseClassId": 3,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Submit Valid New Local License Application (Ahmad, 25 yrs, Class 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/local-license
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantPersonId": 1,
  "licenseClassId": 3,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Get All Local License Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/local-license

### Get Local License Application by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/local-license/1

### Cancel Application (Triggers State Pattern)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/cancel

### ==========================================
### 5. TESTS & EXAMINATIONS (Template Method)
### ==========================================

### Test Template Method: Attempt Theory Test before Vision Test -> Returns HTTP 400 Prerequisite Error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localDrivingLicenseApplicationId": 1,
  "testType": 2,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 1: Schedule Vision Test (TestType = 1, Fee = $10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localDrivingLicenseApplicationId": 1,
  "testType": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-09-11T10:00:00Z",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 2: Take Vision Test (TestResult = 1 for Pass, 0 for Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/1/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testAppointmentId": 1,
  "testResult": 1,
  "notes": "Visual acuity 20/20",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 3: Schedule Theory Test (Now allowed! TestType = 2, Fee = $20)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localDrivingLicenseApplicationId": 1,
  "testType": 2,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-09-12T10:00:00Z",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 4: Take Theory Test (Pass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/2/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testAppointmentId": 2,
  "testResult": 1,
  "notes": "Score: 92/100",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 5: Schedule Practical Test (TestType = 3, Fee = $30)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localDrivingLicenseApplicationId": 1,
  "testType": 3,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-09-13T10:00:00Z",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Step 6: Take Practical Test (Pass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/3/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testAppointmentId": 3,
  "testResult": 1,
  "notes": "Passed practical road test",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Check Passed Test Count (Should be 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tests/passed-count/1

### ==========================================
### 6. LICENSES (Factory Method, Builder, State)
### ==========================================

### Issue First-Time License (Generates 10-year validity for Class 3, completes Application)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/issue-first-time
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localDrivingLicenseApplicationId": 1,
  "notes": "First time issuance",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Get All Licenses (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses

### Get License by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/1

### Get All Drivers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers

### Get Driver by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/1

### Get All Licenses by Driver ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/driver/1

### Issue International Driving License (Requires active Class 3 license, 1-year validity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/international
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localLicenseId": 1,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Detain License (Impound with Fine $150)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/detain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseId": 1,
  "fineFees": 150.00,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Try Renewing while Detained -> Returns HTTP 400 Blocked
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/renew
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseId": 1,
  "notes": "Attempting renew",
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Release Detained License (Pays fine and lifts detention)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/release
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseId": 1,
  "releasedByUserId": 1
}

### Replace Lost License
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/replace-lost
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseId": 1,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Replace Damaged License
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/licenses/replace-damaged
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseId": 1,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}
